    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2879670/extras/8f402363145700fed78ec4f541091c50.avif?t=1746035816\" width=600 height=68 /></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2879670/extras/af6f3e30a0e4388afe39fad9a540e3b3.avif?t=1746035816\" width=600 height=200 /></span><br>With over roughly 10,000 words, &quot;All the Darkest Places&quot; reach into the twist of the player's emotions, exploring themes of love, heartbreak, and lust. Through heartfelt dialogue and vivid storytelling, players will feel the ups and downs of romantic relationships and see how love or lust can conquer challenges.<br><br>Game Content:<br>- 8 Animations<br>- Photo and Video Gallery<br>- Hundred's of Renders<br>- Sandbox and more.<br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2879670/extras/e0ac3d1b4da246b44eb1bd56c1f70197.avif?t=1746035816\" width=600 height=200 /></span><br>Alex, an upcoming freshmen college student, embarks on his journey to university life. He lives with his widowed dad, who has been his support of strength since Alex's mother passed away due to her illness. When he was just 15. This tragic loss left Alex struggling with depression and anxiety, shaping his emotional landscape.<br><br>Now, as Alex prepares to enroll in higher education, his father has made plans for him to stay and live with Laura, a close friend of his late mother. Laura, a divorce woman, carries the scars of a traumatic past marked from her abusive ex-husband.<br><br>As In university, Alex will meet a lot of people with different stories and different challenges. While focusing on his studies, he also faces his own problems like mental health, needing help and seeking support from others. His choices will affect everyone around him, shaping his relationships and experiences.<br><br>As Alex steps into this new chapter, he will struggles with grief, resilience, and human connection. He's about to learn how compassion and understanding can change lives, even in tough times.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2879670/extras/ee63edd0d1c7d17e9d5bc5843cd3b0c6.avif?t=1746035816\" width=600 height=73 /></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2879670/extras/7f6e0b3bbe02b32adccd5b0e4260f98b.avif?t=1746035816\" width=600 height=200 /></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2879670/extras/d36a3694f079d7118d178d247f092259.avif?t=1746035816\" width=600 height=200 /></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2879670/extras/e4d6472b8768b941ba4f68ec86f068c0.avif?t=1746035816\" width=600 height=200 /></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2879670/extras/b5ee29607246473216bde693843e6fe3.avif?t=1746035816\" width=600 height=200 /></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2879670/extras/6a9e90a1a72621c218657268609b6a71.avif?t=1746035816\" width=600 height=200 /></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2879670/extras/d4ed4b666e79f1d692166009bd96affd.avif?t=1746035816\" width=600 height=200 /></span>",
